@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@antiforgeryToken = replace-from-subscription-page
@sessionCookie = replace-with-web-session-and-antiforgery-cookies

### Subscription management remains accessible with an exhausted quota
GET {{baseUrl}}/ResourceSubscription
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Start the Discovery checkout (Premium uses pack=Premium)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ResourceSubscription/Create
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

pack=Discovery&__RequestVerificationToken={{antiforgeryToken}}

### Reconcile confirmed payments from PayPal, including missed webhooks
POST {{baseUrl}}/ResourceSubscription/Refresh
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

__RequestVerificationToken={{antiforgeryToken}}

### Cancel an owned subscription
POST {{baseUrl}}/ResourceSubscription/Cancel
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=replace-with-local-subscription-uuid&__RequestVerificationToken={{antiforgeryToken}}

### A browser return only reconciles server-verified payments
GET {{baseUrl}}/ResourceSubscription/Return?id=replace-with-local-subscription-uuid
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### A forged notification must be rejected; real headers are supplied by PayPal
POST {{baseUrl}}/ResourceSubscription/Notify
Content-Type: application/json

{"event_type":"PAYMENT.SALE.COMPLETED","resource":{"billing_agreement_id":"I-EXAMPLE"}}
